9],["καὶ",707031,7],["τῇ",709436,100],["ἡμέρᾳ",705984,1],["τῇ",709436,100],["ὀγδόῃ",709444,101],["ἐξόδιον",704946,25],["κατὰ",707200,0],["τὸ",709436,24],["κρίμα",707903,25]],"And [Esdras] read in the book of the law of God daily, from the first day even to the last day: and they kept the feast seven days; and on the eighth day a solemn assembly, according to the ordinance."]]